<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,930 --> 00:01:27,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,930 --> 00:01:27,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:43,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you!</font>

32
00:01:43,540 --> 00:01:45,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you sure you want
to look like that?</font>

33
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:48,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, of course!
C'mon! So hurry hurry!</font>

34
00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't regret it later.</font>

35
00:01:52,210 --> 00:01:54,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say cheese!</font>

36
00:01:56,550 --> 00:02:02,560
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">I Am Konohamaru!</font>

37
00:02:18,070 --> 00:02:20,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't decide on how to look.</font>

38
00:02:20,950 --> 00:02:23,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It took me 3 hours to decide.</font>

39
00:02:23,580 --> 00:02:27,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But as you can see,
it's more like a work of art.</font>

40
00:02:27,710 --> 00:02:29,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doesn't it look great?</font>

41
00:02:29,420 --> 00:02:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take it over.</font>

42
00:02:30,790 --> 00:02:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

43
00:02:34,130 --> 00:02:35,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take it over.</font>

44
00:02:36,050 --> 00:02:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop saying that!</font>

45
00:02:44,260 --> 00:02:44,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

46
00:02:48,690 --> 00:02:51,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh please, Hokage-sama...</font>

47
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:11,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sexy Jutsu...
That's quite a devious technique.</font>

48
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:17,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way Naruto,
where's your headband?</font>

49
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:20,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't wear it until the orientation.
It might get scratched</font>

50
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's just fine.</font>

51
00:03:23,390 --> 00:03:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the Ninja Registration Form
is a very important document</font>

52
00:03:27,890 --> 00:03:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">held in high regard by our village.</font>

53
00:03:31,980 --> 00:03:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you want to look like this?</font>

54
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:36,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because!</font>

55
00:03:36,650 --> 00:03:39,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, how should I know
about all that stuff?</font>

56
00:03:42,410 --> 00:03:44,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man!
Get ready to fight!</font>

57
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:49,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am going to be the Fifth Hokage!</font>

58
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

59
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's not one thing, it's another...</font>

60
00:04:00,170 --> 00:04:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Drat! Is this a trap?</font>

61
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:07,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay,
honorable Grandson?</font>

62
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:10,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">May I just inform you that
there aren't any traps here...</font>

63
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What's with this runt?</font>

64
00:04:14,190 --> 00:04:14,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

65
00:04:15,230 --> 00:04:20,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know this kid...
He's that Nine-Tailed boy!</font>

66
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:23,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a good-for-nothing scoundrel!</font>

67
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:26,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must have done this to me!</font>

68
00:04:27,530 --> 00:04:30,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You tripped all by yourself, stupid!</font>

69
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:32,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Let go of him!</font>

70
00:04:32,910 --> 00:04:35,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is the honorable Grandson
of Hokage-sama!</font>

71
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:42,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He stopped as soon as
he learned who I am...</font>

72
00:04:44,010 --> 00:04:46,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's like my four-eyed teacher.</font>

73
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just like everyone else!</font>

74
00:04:48,550 --> 00:04:50,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

75
00:04:50,140 --> 00:04:51,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weren't you gonna hit me, huh?</font>

76
00:04:51,970 --> 00:04:54,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't do it 'cuz
I'm the Hokage's grandson, eh?</font>

77
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As if I care!
Imbecile!</font>

78
00:05:00,730 --> 00:05:01,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

79
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:05,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

80
00:05:05,910 --> 00:05:07,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good grief...</font>

81
00:05:10,660 --> 00:05:11,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen to me.</font>

82
00:05:11,910 --> 00:05:15,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are the honorable Grandson
of Hokage-sama.</font>

83
00:05:15,750 --> 00:05:21,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though that scoundrel hit you,
you must not associate with his kind.</font>

84
00:05:23,630 --> 00:05:26,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing good will come of
your tangling with him.</font>

85
00:05:26,970 --> 00:05:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is your distinguished
teacher Ebisu,</font>

86
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:31,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I am never wrong
about these things!</font>

87
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:34,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you want to become
the Fifth Hokage?</font>

88
00:05:35,350 --> 00:05:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then allow me
to teach you Ninjutsu,</font>

89
00:05:37,940 --> 00:05:40,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so that your dream will
become a reality.</font>

90
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

91
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stick with me and you will gain a shortcut
towards becoming the Fifth Hokage.</font>

92
00:05:47,110 --> 00:05:49,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that clear, honorable Grandson?</font>

93
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:54,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's gone!</font>

94
00:05:55,330 --> 00:05:58,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems he's gone after Naruto.</font>

95
00:05:58,460 --> 00:05:59,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

96
00:05:59,330 --> 00:06:00,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is terrible!</font>

97
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Honorable Grandson!</font>

98
00:06:04,010 --> 00:06:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How did he become like this?</font>

99
00:06:09,510 --> 00:06:13,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was the 20th sneak attack today.</font>

100
00:06:14,470 --> 00:06:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And now he's in the company of Naruto.
I'm a bit worried.</font>

101
00:06:19,810 --> 00:06:23,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just hope he doesn't pick up
more foolishness.</font>

102
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

103
00:07:05,610 --> 00:07:06,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop following me!</font>

104
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:07,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it now?!</font>

105
00:07:11,030 --> 00:07:12,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your camouflage is pathetic.</font>

106
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:20,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've seen through my disguise...</font>

107
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:22,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your reputation is well-earned.</font>

108
00:07:23,710 --> 00:07:26,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will allow you to make me
your apprentice.</font>

109
00:07:29,010 --> 00:07:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you must first teach me that
"Sexy Jutsu" technique</font>

110
00:07:32,050 --> 00:07:34,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you used to beat Grandpa Hokage.</font>

111
00:07:34,890 --> 00:07:36,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You gotta be kidding.</font>

112
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:39,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I beg you to say yes, boss!</font>

113
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:40,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

114
00:07:40,770 --> 00:07:41,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss?</font>

115
00:07:41,810 --> 00:07:44,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss! Boss! Boss!</font>

116
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:47,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I have no choice.</font>

117
00:07:51,490 --> 00:07:52,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen.</font>

118
00:07:52,490 --> 00:07:54,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to become a skilled Ninja,</font>

119
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you must first learn to
control your Chatora.</font>

120
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:58,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chatora?</font>

121
00:08:02,420 --> 00:08:03,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, Chatora.</font>

122
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:07,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss, I think you mean Chakra.</font>

123
00:08:08,170 --> 00:08:09,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Silence!</font>

124
00:08:09,210 --> 00:08:10,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what real Ninja call it!</font>

125
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:13,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! I didn't know that!</font>

126
00:08:14,970 --> 00:08:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whew... I'm glad he's a fool.</font>

127
00:08:17,810 --> 00:08:20,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen. Chakra essentially means...</font>

128
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:24,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Basically, it is the energy needed
in order to use Jutsu.</font>

129
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

130
00:08:25,310 --> 00:08:28,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, fundamentally Ninja Arts
combine the Chakra,</font>

131
00:08:28,820 --> 00:08:32,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the physical energy accumulated
from each cell in the body</font>

132
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:36,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with spiritual energy intensified
through training and experience.</font>

133
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:40,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This combined energy is summoned
with certain hand signs.</font>

134
00:08:40,490 --> 00:08:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You made me think
you knew all that,</font>

135
00:08:41,830 --> 00:08:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when you were just reading
from a scroll!</font>

136
00:08:44,370 --> 00:08:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Much has been said about
perfecting the Ninja techniques,</font>

137
00:08:47,170 --> 00:08:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it really boils down
to just one thing.</font>

138
00:08:50,710 --> 00:08:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what is that?</font>

139
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:54,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hard work and guts.</font>

140
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:56,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hard work and guts?</font>

141
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

142
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So be ready for the challenging tasks
I will give you.</font>

143
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:02,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, boss!</font>

144
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:05,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good. Let's start right now.
Transform for me.</font>

145
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:06,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

146
00:09:07,190 --> 00:09:10,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me see first
how much you already know.</font>

147
00:09:11,070 --> 00:09:13,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what do I transform into?</font>

148
00:09:23,410 --> 00:09:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay... First, transform into that lady.</font>

149
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An easy task, boss.</font>

150
00:09:29,920 --> 00:09:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

151
00:09:32,050 --> 00:09:34,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, do I look like her?</font>

152
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:41,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uhm... Well, the clothes do and...</font>

153
00:09:43,350 --> 00:09:44,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what's so similar
about that?!</font>

154
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:47,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Honorable Grandson.</font>

155
00:09:47,690 --> 00:09:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you will transform into me,
at least try to look a little cuter, okay?</font>

156
00:09:53,110 --> 00:09:53,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's scary!</font>

157
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why am I the one who gets hit?</font>

158
00:10:02,410 --> 00:10:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!
Next, we'll do some research on sexiness!</font>

159
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, boss!</font>

160
00:10:19,930 --> 00:10:24,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you I don't allow
reading here, Naruto!</font>

161
00:10:31,730 --> 00:10:36,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the last test.
Put all of your effort into it!</font>

162
00:10:36,110 --> 00:10:37,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, boss!</font>

163
00:10:37,900 --> 00:10:38,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

164
00:10:54,500 --> 00:10:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! It's you again!</font>

165
00:11:00,970 --> 00:11:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it always me...?</font>

166
00:11:03,930 --> 00:11:05,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Sorry.
— Huh?</font>

167
00:11:05,810 --> 00:11:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because
I'm the Hokage's grandson.</font>

168
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:11,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry about it.</font>

169
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

170
00:11:12,810 --> 00:11:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're now ready to perform
the Sexy Jutsu!</font>

171
00:11:16,940 --> 00:11:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You just need more practice.</font>

172
00:11:22,450 --> 00:11:23,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, boss!</font>

173
00:11:25,030 --> 00:11:27,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, keep in mind...
the point is for "boom boom boom"!</font>

174
00:11:27,950 --> 00:11:28,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now do it!</font>

175
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:31,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, boss!
Transform!</font>

176
00:11:34,170 --> 00:11:36,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think?</font>

177
00:11:38,210 --> 00:11:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That won't do!</font>

178
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More slender.</font>

179
00:11:41,630 --> 00:11:42,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, boss!</font>

180
00:11:43,510 --> 00:11:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this okay?</font>

181
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet.
More attractive.</font>

182
00:11:47,970 --> 00:11:49,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, boss!</font>

183
00:11:49,810 --> 00:11:51,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about now?</font>

184
00:11:54,810 --> 00:11:59,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto... What is he teaching
the Honorable Grandson...?</font>

185
00:12:00,900 --> 00:12:04,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where the hell could they be...?</font>

186
00:12:05,700 --> 00:12:10,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am a distinguished teacher
training potential Hokage.</font>

187
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All those who interfere
will be eliminated.</font>

188
00:12:38,110 --> 00:12:39,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know I've been wondering...</font>

189
00:12:39,190 --> 00:12:42,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You seem obsessed with beating
your Grandpa Hokage.</font>

190
00:12:45,910 --> 00:12:48,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Konohamaru.</font>

191
00:12:48,910 --> 00:12:51,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was Grandpa who gave me
that name.</font>

192
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He named me after our village.</font>

193
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:59,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It should be easy for everyone
here to remember.</font>

194
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:02,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But nobody ever calls me
by that name.</font>

195
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:09,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When they see me, all they see
is the Grandson of the Hokage.</font>

196
00:13:10,930 --> 00:13:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one sees me for who I really am.</font>

197
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:16,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stand it anymore.</font>

198
00:13:17,310 --> 00:13:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why...</font>

199
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:22,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I want the title
of Hokage now.</font>

200
00:13:25,990 --> 00:13:29,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot... Who do you think
will accept you, huh?</font>

201
00:13:29,910 --> 00:13:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

202
00:13:30,830 --> 00:13:34,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't win the title
that easily, you know.</font>

203
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

204
00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:37,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not that simple.</font>

205
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're really serious about gaining
the title of Hokage...</font>

206
00:13:44,670 --> 00:13:45,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

207
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:50,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll have to beat me first!</font>

208
00:14:05,530 --> 00:14:09,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!
I've been looking for you.</font>

209
00:14:09,740 --> 00:14:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka.</font>

210
00:14:11,490 --> 00:14:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did Naruto re-submit
his Ninja Registration Form?</font>

211
00:14:15,830 --> 00:14:16,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

212
00:14:16,710 --> 00:14:19,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I lectured to him the other night
at the ramen stand,</font>

213
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:24,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he said he will make everyone accept him
now that he's a Ninja.</font>

214
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:26,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's been happy since then.</font>

215
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:37,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It might not be easy for Naruto
to realize that dream.</font>

216
00:14:37,430 --> 00:14:38,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

217
00:14:38,850 --> 00:14:40,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you well know,</font>

218
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:46,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only the villagers who fought
the Nine-Tailed Fox Spirit 12 years ago</font>

219
00:14:46,570 --> 00:14:50,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">know that the monster is sealed
inside Naruto.</font>

220
00:14:51,990 --> 00:14:55,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I ruled that no one shall speak
about that incident.</font>

221
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:59,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have severely punished those
who have broken this rule.</font>

222
00:15:00,370 --> 00:15:04,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now our children know nothing about it.</font>

223
00:15:04,210 --> 00:15:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is the only positive
development for Naruto.</font>

224
00:15:08,010 --> 00:15:13,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before the Fourth Hokage trapped
the monster and died,</font>

225
00:15:13,140 --> 00:15:16,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">his last wish was for the villagers
to regard Naruto as a hero.</font>

226
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A hero?</font>

227
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fourth Hokage sealed the monster
into the navel of a newborn baby</font>

228
00:15:22,940 --> 00:15:24,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">whose umbilical cord
had just been cut.</font>

229
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:28,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As the receptacle
for the Nine-Tailed Fox Spirit,</font>

230
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:30,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto saved the village.</font>

231
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunately, the other villagers
don't see him like that.</font>

232
00:15:36,910 --> 00:15:41,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some even say that Naruto is
the Nine-Tailed Fox Spirit himself.</font>

233
00:15:42,580 --> 00:15:46,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Little by little, that attitude has been</font>

234
00:15:46,460 --> 00:15:50,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">passed down to their own children.</font>

235
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:55,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka.
Do you know?</font>

236
00:15:56,010 --> 00:15:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, sir?</font>

237
00:15:57,470 --> 00:16:01,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When someone is hated and people refuse
to accept his existence,</font>

238
00:16:02,310 --> 00:16:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he sees it in the eyes
of the people around him.</font>

239
00:16:14,280 --> 00:16:15,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have found you!</font>

240
00:16:15,910 --> 00:16:16,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

241
00:16:21,410 --> 00:16:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Demon Fox!</font>

242
00:16:24,750 --> 00:16:27,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That cold look!
It's always like that!</font>

243
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Honorable Grandson,
we have to go now.</font>

244
00:16:32,420 --> 00:16:33,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

245
00:16:33,630 --> 00:16:37,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to beat Grandpa right now
so I can win the title of Hokage!</font>

246
00:16:37,970 --> 00:16:38,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get in my way!</font>

247
00:16:39,180 --> 00:16:43,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Hokage must first know about virtue,
honor, etiquette, wisdom, loyalty, faith,</font>

248
00:16:43,350 --> 00:16:44,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">judgment, obedience
and all that.</font>

249
00:16:45,310 --> 00:16:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He must be skilled at more than
thousand techniques...</font>

250
00:16:47,610 --> 00:16:48,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then...</font>

251
00:16:49,270 --> 00:16:49,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

252
00:16:54,110 --> 00:16:56,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this! Sexy Jutsu!</font>

253
00:16:59,410 --> 00:17:01,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?
It didn't work!</font>

254
00:17:01,160 --> 00:17:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of a
disgraceful spell is that?!</font>

255
00:17:05,330 --> 00:17:06,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am a gentleman!</font>

256
00:17:07,170 --> 00:17:10,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such vulgar attacks
will never work on me!</font>

257
00:17:12,170 --> 00:17:16,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Honorable Grandson!
That rascal will only make you an imbecile!</font>

258
00:17:18,010 --> 00:17:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stick with me and...</font>

259
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:23,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will gain a shortcut
towards becoming the Fifth Hokage.</font>

260
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon, let's go!</font>

261
00:17:25,140 --> 00:17:26,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

262
00:17:26,650 --> 00:17:27,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu</font>

263
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:37,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow!
Fantastic!</font>

264
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ha!
That's nothing.</font>

265
00:17:46,370 --> 00:17:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am a distinguished teacher.</font>

266
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am not as weak as Mizuki.</font>

267
00:18:06,770 --> 00:18:07,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss...</font>

268
00:18:12,610 --> 00:18:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

269
00:18:13,610 --> 00:18:16,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

270
00:18:21,530 --> 00:18:23,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Ebisu-sama...</font>

271
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:36,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I call it "the Harem Jutsu"!</font>

272
00:18:38,090 --> 00:18:42,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He combined the Multiple Clones with
his own Sexy Jutsu.</font>

273
00:18:42,930 --> 00:18:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's another devious attack.</font>

274
00:18:45,930 --> 00:18:49,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I probably won't even survive that one.</font>

275
00:18:54,730 --> 00:18:59,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't even beat that
four-eyed teacher of mine!</font>

276
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:03,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want the title of Hokage so badly!
I want to be recognized by everybody!</font>

277
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:04,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I keep failing.</font>

278
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think it's that easy?</font>

279
00:19:06,950 --> 00:19:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

280
00:19:08,710 --> 00:19:11,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's given only to the greatest Ninja
in the village.</font>

281
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:14,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody must learn to believe in you.</font>

282
00:19:17,630 --> 00:19:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been through a lot already.</font>

283
00:19:20,630 --> 00:19:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been one struggle after another.</font>

284
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But after all that,
I found someone who accepts me.</font>

285
00:19:29,100 --> 00:19:31,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had to go through a lot...
Just for one person.</font>

286
00:19:33,190 --> 00:19:35,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You had better push yourself.</font>

287
00:19:35,690 --> 00:19:36,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For what?</font>

288
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:43,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The path of getting the title,
Hokage, is a brutal one.</font>

289
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:55,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no such thing as a shortcut.</font>

290
00:20:00,550 --> 00:20:02,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're really serious about
attaining the title of Hokage</font>

291
00:20:03,340 --> 00:20:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll have to beat me first.</font>

292
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:12,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who do you think you are,
lecturing me like that?</font>

293
00:20:14,150 --> 00:20:16,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be your apprentice anymore.</font>

294
00:20:21,700 --> 00:20:24,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now on, you're my rival.</font>

295
00:20:29,540 --> 00:20:33,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunately for you,
tomorrow I graduate from the Ninja Academy.</font>

296
00:20:34,330 --> 00:20:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still, I'll consider you an equal someday
when we fight for the title of Hokage.</font>

297
00:20:42,010 --> 00:20:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's look forward to that, Konohamaru.</font>

298
00:21:09,740 --> 00:21:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still have a long way to go
to become a real Ninja.</font>

299
00:21:33,390 --> 00:21:36,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

300
00:21:36,770 --> 00:21:40,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

301
00:21:40,230 --> 00:21:43,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

302
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:47,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

303
00:21:50,580 --> 00:21:53,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

